          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“You shall not boil a kid in its mother's milk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Behold, I send an angel before you, to guard you on the way and to bring you to the place which I have prepared. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give heed to him and hearken to his voice, do not rebel against him, for he will not pardon your transgression; for my name is in him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“But if you hearken attentively to his voice and do all that I say, then I will be an enemy to your enemies and an adversary to your adversaries.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“When my angel goes before you, and brings you in to the Amorites, and the Hittites, and the Perizzites, and the Canaanites, the Hivites, and the Jebusites, and I blot them out, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "you shall not bow down to their gods, nor serve them, nor do according to their works, but you shall utterly overthrow them and break their pillars in pieces. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall serve the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, and I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23.25",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gk Vg: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "he",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " will bless your bread and your water; and I will take sickness away from the midst of you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None shall cast her young or be barren in your land; I will fulfil the number of your days. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will send my terror before you, and will throw into confusion all the people against whom you shall come, and I will make all your enemies turn their backs to you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will send hornets before you, which shall drive out Hivite, Canaanite, and Hittite from before you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will not drive them out from before you in one year, lest the land become desolate and the wild beasts multiply against you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Little by little I will drive them out from before you, until you are increased and possess the land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will set your bounds from the Red Sea to the sea of the Philistines, and from the wilderness to the Euphrates; for I will deliver the inhabitants of the land into your hand, and you shall drive them out before you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall make no covenant with them or with their gods. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They shall not dwell in your land, lest they make you sin against me; for if you serve their gods, it will surely be a snare to you.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
